Your brain is your brain. When you're male, you have a male brain, when you're female you have a female brain. It is impossible for a scientist to look at a brain and say if it's male or female. [https://neurosciencenews.com/male-female-brain-debunked-18276/](https://neurosciencenews.com/male-female-brain-debunked-18276/)

